config CHARY_PMW3610_PERIPHERAL_COMPAT
    bool
    default y if SHIELD_CHARY_RIGHT && ZMK_SPLIT && !ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL && PMW3610
    help
      Supply the one keymap query required by the legacy PMW3610 driver when
      the sensor is running on a split peripheral. Layer-based processing is
      performed by the dongle instead.

config CHARY_BOND_REPAIR_ONCE
    bool
    default y if (SHIELD_CHARY_LEFT || SHIELD_CHARY_RIGHT || SHIELD_CHARY_DONGLE) && ZMK_BLE
    depends on SETTINGS && BT
    help
      Remove all legacy host and split Bluetooth bonds once, save a persistent
      migration marker, and reboot. Subsequent boots keep the newly established
      bonds normally.
